f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Do you offer custom-sized mats?","text":"<p>Custom sizes by the foot are also available. If you'd like to order a custom size please call us at1-866-362-2053 or email us at <a href=\"mailto:%20sales@matsupplier.com\">sales@canadamats.c<\/a>a<\/p>"}},"template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-16861021769c2b147a-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What makes these Tatami Mats IJF approved?","text":"<p>These mats are certified by the <strong>International Judo Federation (IJF)<\/strong>, ensuring they meet the highest standards for <strong>quality, safety, and performance<\/strong>. Designed for both professional competition and training, they provide excellent cushioning, grip, and stability to support athletes during high-intensity matches.<\/p>"}},"dba51aba-7297-4b62-b757-d92d0c035f48":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Are these mats suitable for both judo and other martial arts?","text":"<p>Yes, the <strong>IJF Approved Tatami Mats<\/strong> are versatile and designed for a range of martial arts, including judo, grappling, and other combat sports. With their multi-layer construction and anti-slip surface, these mats deliver the necessary <strong>shock absorption and support<\/strong> for various techniques and training styles.<\/p>"}},"question_YgrmPX":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What are the material options for these mats?","text":"<p>The mats come with two material options for optimal performance: <strong>XPE foam (crosslinked polyethylene)<\/strong> for firmer support, or <strong>PU (Polyurethane)<\/strong> for softer cushioning. Both options are paired with a durable vinyl surface featuring a rice pattern texture for enhanced grip and safety.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14491778515073__758f7b87-b80b-4940-9ae6-e317e6db90e5-1686